This is a known bug in vanilla where mon_consume_unstone() displays
the "slowing down" message for all cases, assuming that the 
monster is eating it to cure stoning.  This isn't necessarily true,
though, as eating a lizard can also cure other statuses (such as
stunning) that the Elf might have brought on him/herself previously -- 
and only felt it needed to cure once you walked into view.

I submitted it a couple months back, and I _think_ it's already been
fixed in the current vanilla codebase as C343-330, but the description
is vague and my memory is even vaguer, so YMMV on that one.

